PARITY (web source is THE spec — every region, branch, and i18n key reproduced)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Data sources    useDriveColumns (local) / useTranslation / useUnits  -> bound via P1/S8 source seam
  Shared comps    @/components/ui (GlassPanel, DataTable) -> RecentDrivesSectionGlassPanel + TSDataTable
                  @/components/feedback (EmptyState)        -> ContentUnavailableView
  Charts / maps   none (spec)                               -> none
  i18n keys       common.date / common.distance / common.duration / common.battery /
                  common.recentDrives / common.viewAll / common.noDrives  (+ native chrome drives.*)
  Column parity   Date     = formatDateTime(start_ts), "—" when absent/invalid
                  Distance = `${fmtNumber(convertDistanceFromSI(distance_m ?? 0, unit))} ${unit}` (prec 2;
                             km=/1000, mi=/1609.344, ft=/0.3048); sortable on the raw SI meters
                  Duration = durationStr((duration_s ?? 0)/60) -> floor(h) + fmtInt(m)
                  Battery  = start!=null && end!=null ? "{s}% → {e}%" : "—"
  States          loading / empty / error / content + the orthogonal live|stale|offline freshness axis
                  (chip + banner + one-shot stale auto-refresh). Telemetry: view.opened slug
                  "RecentDrivesSection" emitted once on first appearance (P1/S11).

